      "created_at": "2025-06-04T23:44:16.310Z",
      "resolved_at": null,
      "message": "Hi @Christopher Logan - we should have a single touch option here as well with drag+drop to make this accessible for mobility/dexterity users. It can also benefit plenty of AT users (TalkBack, Voice Access, etc). This method is just an example, but as you tap or long press on a button, an action sheet/menu comes up that contains buttons to move up or down (and in this case left or right). Here is the example for reference- https://m3.material.io/components/cards/accessibility#26b009bd-1ae2-4409-add7-6059827091ee\n\nPlease let me know if you have any questions, thank you!",
      "reactions": [],
